    <summary>Rust CLI and library for public HTTP(S)/SOCKS4/5 proxy discovery, validation, and rotating serving.</summary>
    <description>
Zuli ProxyBroker Extended is a Rust CLI and library that discovers public proxies,
validates and classifies them by anonymity, and serves a rotating proxy endpoint, with
offline DB-IP country lookup. The executable is `proxybroker`.

This portable package downloads the official x86_64 Windows release archive from the
canonical GitHub Release and verifies its SHA-256 checksum before installing. The archive
ships with the Apache-2.0 LICENSE, the DB-IP CC BY 4.0 data notice (LICENSE-DATA), and NOTICE.
